=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">4.9★ mula sa 176 review</a></li><li>Mag-book online</li><li>Linggo by appointment</li><li>Mga bata at senior</li><li>Libreng Wi-Fi</li><li>Accessible sa wheelchair</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">Ang shop</p><h2>Hindi lang gupit. Isang karanasan.</h2><p>Ang Marty&#39;s ay rustic-modern na barbershop sa Nut Tree Road na may magandang vibe at maraming mahuhusay na barbero. Ang pilosopiya ng shop: &quot;Kapag maganda ang itsura mo, laging maganda ang pakiramdam mo.&quot;</p><p>Si Marty at ang aming team ay may mahigit 1,300 client review na may average na 4.9. I-book online ang barbero mo, o tawagan ang shop.</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Marty%27s+Barbershop/@38.334085,-121.954199,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d18bfa90d17:0x87e0c0043f59cd49!8m2!3d38.334085!4d-121.954199!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.9★</b><span>176 review</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>1,332</b><span>Client review para sa aming mga barbero</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>9</b><span>Barberong puwedeng i-book</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/interior.jpg\" alt=\"Sa loob ng Marty&#39;s Barbershop\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Menu</p><h2>Gupit at presyo</h2><p>Ang menu ni Marty, kasama ang iba pa naming serbisyo. Bawat barbero ay may sariling menu; i-tap ang barbero sa ibaba para makita ang kanya.</p></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Gupit</h3><span class=\"price\">$40</span></div><p>Fade, taper, burst fade, mohawk, comb over, at iba pa.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Gupit at balbas</h3><