 class=\"amenities\"><li><b>Mag-book online</b><span>Lahat ng barbero ay tumatanggap ng online appointment</span></li><li><b>Linggo, by appointment lang</b></li><li><b>Accessible sa wheelchair</b></li><li><b>Tumatanggap ng credit card</b></li><li><b>Libreng Wi-Fi</b></li><li><b>Paradahan</b><span>May paradahan din ng bisikleta</span></li><li><b>Pambata</b></li><li><b>Presyo para sa senior at militar</b><span>May presyo ang ilang barbero para sa 65+ at militar/first responder</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Gallery</p><h2>Sa loob ng Marty&#39;s</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/shop-floor.jpg\" alt=\"Mga barber station sa loob ng Marty&#39;s\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/taper.jpg\" alt=\"Low taper fade\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/hot-towel-shave.jpg\" alt=\"Hot towel shave\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fade.jpg\" alt=\"Bagong fade\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/beard.jpg\" alt=\"Beard trim at line-up\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/side-part.jpg\" alt=\"Side part na may fade\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/kids-fade.jpg\" alt=\"Fade pambata\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/team.jpg\" alt=\"Mga barbero sa pasukan ng shop\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Mga review</p><h2>Sabi ng aming mga customer</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 176 review</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Marty%27s+Barbershop/@38.334085,-121.954199,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d18bfa90d17:0x87e0c0043f59cd49!8m2!3d38.334085!4d-121.954199!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Magbasa pa ng mga review sa Google →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Booksy</b> · 1332 review</div><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1040320_martys-barbershop_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Magbasa pa ng mga review sa Booksy →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Marty’s Barbershop delivers excellent service in a professional and welcoming environment. Marty is highly skilled, consistent and provides great hospitality. My Barber, Foofades is also outstanding, with great attention to detail and overall an amazing guy to talk to.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Feb 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Best barber out in Vacaville, never disappointed me every time I came in🫡💯”</blockquote><figcaption>— Jaden · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/263621_martythebarber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I was literally walking out of my doctors appointment thinking about looking for a barber when I crossed paths with the owner. He brought me in and the vibes were amazing. Great people, amazing skills and overall amazing experience. It didn’t feel like going in to just get a cut. I got an experience.You gotta get a fresh cut from these guys.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Feb 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Viv does an amazing job! She’s thorough, detail-oriented, and listens to her clients. Every haircut I’ve gotten from her is great and grows out well between cuts!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Kendra · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/658054_hercuts_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · May 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Thank you, Hudson for making our first experience at this barbershop and with you great! It is evident you take pride in your craft and the results show for itself. We are very satisfied with our son’s haircut by you. I definitely recommend booking with him. Thank you!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Jared always does a great job. Great attention to Detail and many years of experience. If you’re looking for a new barber,Jared is the guy. He’s been cutting my hair for over 10 years.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Bradley · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1694168_thatboy-reezy_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“He cut my haircut like how I imagined it. Takes his time and doesn’t rush. Cleanest skin mid fade in the area”</blockquote><figcaption>— Nish · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/966669_joe-big-money-lopez_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Sep 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Carlos provided a great cut along with efficient timing, I would highly recommend his services!👌🏽”</blockquote><figcaption>— Emani · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/593463_losblendzz_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“10/10 recommend this shop! Marty cuts my sons hair an always is quick, smooth and always makes my sons experience exceptional. If your not getting your hair cut here your missing out.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great haircut, Good convo &amp; Good vibes. Eli got me right. Thanks!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Alex024 · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1244424_fadezbyeli-martysbarbershop_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">FAQ</p><h2>Mga tanong, sinagot</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>Kailangan ko ba ng appointment?</summary><p>Puwede mong i-book online ang kahit sino sa amin. Tuwing Linggo ay by appointment lang, at welcome ang walk-in sa oras namin tuwing weekday at Sabado.</p></details><details><summary>Magkano ang gupit?</summary><p>Ang karaniwang gupit ay $40–$50, depende sa barbero. Tingnan ang booking page ng barbero mo para sa kasalukuyang presyo.</p></details><details><summary>May discount ba kayo para sa senior o militar?</summary><p>Oo. Ang ilan sa aming mga barbero ay may gupit para sa senior (65+) sa $30 at para sa militar/first responder sa $35–$40.</p></details><details><summary>May hot towel shave ba kayo?</summary><p>Siyempre. Si Marty ay may tradisyonal na shave sa $40, at gupit kasama ang tradisyonal na shave na may hot towel sa $75. Gumagawa rin ng tradisyonal na razor shave sina Viviana at Joe.</p></details><details><summary>Tumatanggap ba kayo ng card?</summary><p>Oo, tumatanggap kami ng card.</p></details><details><summary>May Wi-Fi ba at accessible ba?</summary><p>Oo. May libre kaming Wi-Fi, at accessible sa wheelchair ang shop.</p></details><details><summary>Anong oras kayo bukas?</summary><p>Bukas kami Lun–Biy 9 AM–6 PM at Sab 9 AM–3 PM. Tuwing Linggo, by appointment lang.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">Bisitahin kami</p>\n      <h2>Oras at lokasyon</h2>\n      <address>2611 Nut Tree Rd Ste E<br>Vacaville, CA 95687</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17076608108\">(707) 660-8108</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>Lunes</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>Martes</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>Miyerkules</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>Huwebes</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>Biyernes</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>Sabado</td><td>9 AM – 3 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>Linggo</td><td>Sarado</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">Tuwing Linggo, by appointment lang.</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/martysbarbershop_/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10zm0 2a3 3 0 1 1 0 6 3 3 0 0 1 0-6zm5.5-3a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3z\"/></svg><span>@martysbarbershop_</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1040320_martys